  [PASS] LC1 LCDM CONTROL -- AUGER+2010'S DARK FRACTIONS: stars (de Vaucouleurs, r_e,V) + NFW (break radius 30 kpc) normalised to the lensing mass reproduce Auger+2010 Table 1's projected f_DM inside r_e/2 at both IMFs
         measured: Chabrier: median diff +0.000, median |diff| 0.026; Salpeter: median diff +0.018, median |diff| 0.029
