  [PASS] LC2 LCDM CONTROL -- TREU+2010'S PER-LENS IMF: stars (Hernquist, a = r_e/1.8153) + NFW (r_b = 30 kpc), isotropic, alpha and the halo from M_E and sigma_SDSS together, reproduce Treu+2010's log alpha_Salp lens by lens
